/E (     he transition from high school to college is a pivotal moment, and for the incoming First-Year students of 2025-2029 batch, that journey officially began with an interactive Induction Programme, from 15th to 19th October, 2025. Though held online, the event successfully introduced essential campus resources and induced a sense of community, all through screens.)
/Pg 7 0 R
