/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (various departments. Heads of Computer Science and Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Civil Engineering, Electronics and Communication Engineering, and Electrical Engineering departments presented their visions, highlighted ongoing research, and introduced key faculty members. This helped to explain the specific fields of study associated with every department and showcased the opportunities within each. Furthermore, a portion of each day was dedicated to the introduction of various cultural and technical clubs and cells, ensuring students understood the vast co-curricular landscape available to them from the very start.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [48 49]
