/E (The event was marked by the participation of students who came forward to express their respect and admiration for the nation in creative ways. Among the highlights of the program was an innovative performance by Prithwiraj Sarkar, a 2nd year CSE student, who, along with his batchmates, showcased his patriotism through a remarkable drone show. What made this performance truly special was that the drone was entirely self-designed and self-built by Prithwiraj, symbolizing the essence of Aatmanirbhar Bharat \(self-reliant India\). The drone gracefully hovered in the sky, forming the tiranga and leaving the audience spellbound..)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [18 19]
