<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As the workshop progressed, the curriculum delved into the more intricate aspects of Python. Participants were introduced to a variety of advanced data structures such as lists, dictionaries, tuples, and sets. The instructor, a senior student with extensive programming experience, explained the unique properties of each structure and provided practical examples of how to use them to solve common programming challenges. Following this, the focus shifted to functions and object-oriented programming \(OOP\). Students learned to create reusable functions to modularize their code and were given a clear introduction to classes and objects. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [24 25]
>>
endobj
