/E (With the blowing of the ceremonial whistle, the tournament officially commenced, and the crowd erupted into applause. The stands were gradually filling with enthusiastic students cheering for their respective departments. Colorful banners added a festive touch to the entire atmosphere. Volunteers coordinated effectively, and the referee took his position. The tournament began with knockouts, giving each department a fair chance to exhibit their strengths)
/Pg 12 0 R
