/S /P
/E (The match was a true reflection of both departments' specialties: precision and speed. CSE relied on quick, aggressive attacks, while EE demonstrated methodical control over the midfield and clinical finishing.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
345 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (After a hard-fought contest characterized by disciplined defence and sharp attacking moves from both sides, the Electrical Engineering team ultimately prevailed over CSE to be crowned this year's champions! The field erupted in celebrations as players from both sides displayed mutual respect. The Electrical Engineering team proudly lifted the championship trophy amidst loud applause. "This is one of the best comebacks I've ever seen in CGEC's football culture", said Bibek Mahata \(4th year\), the ex-incharge of the Sports Club of the college to our reporters. "It is not at all easy to win a match against a team like CSE", opined the captain of EE team, Koushik Bauri \(4th year\), "we want to congratulate CSE as well for the challenges they've made us face on ground, and we will forever remember this one match against them". .More than just a competition, the tournament achieved its core objective: promoting unity and a healthy competitive spirit among students from different engineering disciplines. It was a refreshing break from the academic grind, reminding everyone of the importance of physical fitness and teamwork.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [13 14]
>>
